sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Fuseki as Fuseki
    participant VC as VC DB
    participant Oracle as Orakelj (vozlišče)
    participant Agg as Agregator
    participant Chain as Blockchain – TrustGraph.sol

    rect rgba(200,230,255,0.25)
        Oracle->>Fuseki: Pridobi/posodobi ontologijo (SPARQL / lokalni OWL)
        Oracle->>VC: Naloži VC in preveri preklic
        Oracle-->>Oracle: Izvede hibridni eval (pravila + Beta statistika)
        Oracle-->>Oracle: Vključi policy_hash + credential_hash
        Oracle->>Agg: POST /reports (request_id, SignedOracleReport)
    end

    Agg->>Agg: Preveri podpis (EIP-191) + allowlist
    Agg->>Agg: Deduplikacija (request_id, node_id)
    Agg->>Chain: recordOracleSubmission(requestId, evaluatorHash,…)

    Agg-->>Agg: Hrani poročila do kvoruma

    alt Dosežen kvorum
        Agg->>Agg: Agregira (večina bool, mediana score, bitni flagi)
        Agg->>Agg: Preveri credential_hash proti VC DB
        Agg->>Chain: fulfillTrustReport(requestId, agregat)
    else Premalo poročil / napaka
        Agg-->>Agg: Čaka ali zavrne (logiranje)
    end

    Chain-->>Agg: Dogodki (OracleReportRecorded / TrustOracleFulfilled)
